  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6446, eff 2-1-97; ss by #7243, eff 5-1-00; ss by #8740, INTERIM, eff 10-13-06, EXPIRED: 4-11-07 New. #8869, eff 4-19-07; ss by #10803, eff 3-26-15; ss by #14299, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35 (formerly He-W 655.07)",
